    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>These services provide critical information required to assess the physical properties of soil earthworks and foundations for purposes of construction and repair.</p>
<p>Our accredited laboratories and mobile facilities are equipped to perform the following testing services according to testing standards set by ASTM, SANAS, BSI and more.</p>]]></Value>
